<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44958" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spēlunca</span></b> , ae,
		f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπήλυγξ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>gen.</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γγος</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A cave</i>, <i>cavern</i>, <i>den</i> (class.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">syn. specus): Philocteta jam decimum annum in
					speluncā jacet,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fin. 2, 29, 94</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Verr. 2, 4, 48, § 107</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">id. Fat.
				3, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Fl. 17, 39</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 2,
				469</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 145</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 364</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. A. 1,
			60</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">viridis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop. 3,
					3</span></i>
			 (4, 2), 27: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pumice pendens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Am. 3, 1, 3</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Val.
				Fl. 4, 177 al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Spelunca, <i>name of a
				country-seat of Tiberius</i>, <i>near
			Terracina</i>, <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 4, 59</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Tib. 39</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5, 9, §
		59</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
